    "markdown": "# Handy tips & tricks\n![](/images/magic.png){style=\"width:200px; border-radius:15px; background:white\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nWelcome to the final part of the workshops, Handy tips & tricks! \nThis part will include coding to reinforce what you have learnt up to this point. \nThere will also be plenty of new handy <u id='function_tooltip'>__functions__</u> and some more concepts to learn.\n\n## Setup\n\nFor this part create a directory called \"tips_and_tricks\" in your main directory and set it as the working directory. \nThen create a script called \"4-Handy_tips.R\". \nRemember to use annotations (`#`) and code sections (`####`)!\n\n## Sections & pages\n\nBelow is an overview of the contents of this part.\n\n- [R conventions](tips_tricks/variable_names.qmd): Conventions on variable names and wide vs long coding\n- [RStudio] \n- [Multiplication table](tips_tricks/multiplication_table.qmd): \n    - href: tips_tricks/tab_complete.qmd\n    - section: \"Example datasets\"\n      contents:\n      - href: tips_tricks/tea.qmd\n      - href: tips_tricks/english_speakers.qmd\n    - href: tips_tricks/identical.qmd\n    - href: tips_tricks/shortcuts.qmd\n    - href: tips_tricks/mcqs.qmd\n    - section: \"Exercises\"\n      contents:\n      - href: tips_tricks/handy_exercises.qmd\n\nI'll first introduce you to some R conventions and then some useful abilities of RStudio.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ff5347f1c8228896dab5\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ff5347f1c8228896dab5\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-2cac2bd7295ce792f32c\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2cac2bd7295ce792f32c\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7a42205c318991d3ce29\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7a42205c318991d3ce29\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7b892879372e250474f0\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7b892879372e250474f0\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-e1054f1fd84c8c3a9c92\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e1054f1fd84c8c3a9c92\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-2b910ac4f27f5b0ec0b6\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2b910ac4f27f5b0ec0b6\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a16af7a074ab06b76912\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a16af7a074ab06b76912\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-d77adc45f6da297305ec\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-d77adc45f6da297305ec\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3a51899e15b25f6a6c11\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3a51899e15b25f6a6c11\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1985d9e2d390934cc08a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1985d9e2d390934cc08a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c3d8b2c5521